#: guide/en/wikitolearn-guide-chapter-9.txt:1
msgid ""
"If you have some material written in <code>.doc</code> format, you can "
"convert it to WikiToLearn."
msgstr ""

#: guide/en/wikitolearn-guide-chapter-9.txt:3
msgid ""
"Conversion is a little tricky. You can simply copy and paste text into the "
"Visual editor, but it does not work for formulas, etc. Take a look "
"[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:WordToWiki#VisualEditor here] to find "
"other possibilities on how to import content."
msgstr ""

